dates python_isinstance v1
description "A date with the alias isinstance, in a file with an integer input. The function at the top of the Python module hides the built-in isinstance that checks the input (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  n        : int   range >=0 <=3

date isinstance = received
  + n days
